# Macro JSON Ingestion Template

To inject a completely structured sprint into the Command Center `macro-inject` engine, any secondary LLM must output a raw JSON payload strictly adhering to the following structure.

This payload maps to the `MacroSprintCreate` Pydantic Schema.

## Example Payload

```json
{
  "title": {
    "en": "Low-Level Programming v2",
    "ar": "البرمجة منخفضة المستوى (الإصدار 2)"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Focus on memory management, system calls, and extreme optimization in C.",
    "ar": "التركيز على إدارة الذاكرة، نداءات النظام، والتحسين العميق في لغة C."
  },
  "projects": [
    {
      "title": {
        "en": "0x0C. C - More malloc, free",
        "ar": "0x0C. لغة C - المزيد عن الذاكرة"
      },
      "directory_name": "0x0c-more_malloc_free",
      "global_constraints": ["No standard library", "Betty linter checks"],
      "forbidden_functions": ["printf", "puts", "calloc"],
      "compiler_flags": ["-Wall", "-Werror", "-Wextra", "-pedantic"],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "title": {
            "en": "0. Trust no one",
            "ar": "0. لا تثق بأحد"
          },
          "task_type": "mandatory",
          "allowed_syscalls": ["malloc", "free"],
          "technical_requirements": {
            "en": "Write a function that allocates memory using malloc. Prototype: void *malloc_checked(unsigned int b);",
            "ar": "اكتب وظيفة تخصص الذاكرة باستخدام malloc. إذا فشلت، يجب إنهاء العملية بالحالة 98."
          },
          "example_main_code": "int main(void) { char *c = malloc_checked(1024); free(c); return (0); }",
          "raw_terminal_output": "...",
          "skills_awarded": {
            "Memory Allocation": 50,
            "C Programming": 100
          }
        },
        {
          "title": {
            "en": "1. string_nconcat",
            "ar": "1. دمج النصوص"
          },
          "task_type": "advanced",
          "allowed_syscalls": ["malloc", "free"],
          "technical_requirements": {
            "en": "Write a function that concatenates two strings.",
            "ar": "اكتب وظيفة تدمج نصين."
          },
          "example_main_code": "",
          "raw_terminal_output": "",
          "skills_awarded": {
            "Pointer Arithmetic": 75
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## How to use:
Paste this generated JSON string directly into the JSON Injector via the Macro Payload terminal. The system parses the sequence and routes it atomically into `POST /api/sprints/macro-inject` which natively bootstraps the Sprint, inside of which are the Projects, inside of which are the Tasks within a single unified SQL transaction.
